  "description": "Engaged Micro Amp circuit based on the GGG 2012 trace with the documented original 50 pF feedback capacitor. The 8.8 V rail approximates the 9 V supply after the original germanium protection diode. Uses the TL061 card with estimated 1.3–7.5 V output swing. Bypass switching and the indicator are omitted.",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Gain"
    ]
  },
  "name": "MXR Micro Amp",
  "outputNode": "out",
